#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:6
msgid "PMP Driver"
msgstr "PMP 驱动"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:8
msgid ""
"Provides an API for configuring the Physical Memory Protection (PMP) unit"
" on RISC-V cores. PMP allows M-mode software to restrict physical memory "
"access privileges (read, write, execute) for each defined region, "
"enforced in hardware for U-mode and optionally for M-mode when locked."
msgstr ""
"提供用于配置 RISC-V 内核上物理内存保护（PMP）单元的 API。PMP 允许 M 模式软件"
"限制每个已定义区域的物理内存访问权限（读、写、执行），在硬件上对 U 模式强制执行，"
"并且在锁定时可选择对 M 模式强制执行。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:13
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:15
msgid ""
"The PMP unit supports up to **8 entries**. Each entry defines one "
"protected memory region and a set of access permissions."
msgstr ""
"PMP 单元支持最多 **8 个条目**。每个条目定义一个受保护的内存区域和一组访问权限。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:18
msgid ""
"Any violation is trapped precisely at the processor. The trap cause can "
"be inspected via `mcause`, `mdcause`, and `mtval` CSRs."
msgstr ""
"任何违规都会在处理器处精确捕获。可以通过 `mcause`、`mdcause` 和 `mtval` CSR "
"检查异常原因。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:22
msgid "Address Matching Modes"
msgstr "地址匹配模式"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:24
msgid "Each entry operates in one of two address matching modes:"
msgstr "每个条目在以下两种地址匹配模式之一中运行："

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:60
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`TOR`"
msgstr "`TOR`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`tlk_pmp_tor_config`"
msgstr "`tlk_pmp_tor_config`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid ""
"Top Of Range. The protected region is `[pmpaddr[entry-1], address)`. For "
"entry 0, the lower bound is implicitly `0x00000000`."
msgstr ""
"范围顶部。保护区域为 `[pmpaddr[entry-1], address)`。"
"对于条目 0，下限隐式为 `0x00000000`。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`NAPOT`"
msgstr "`NAPOT`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`tlk_pmp_napot_config`"
msgstr "`tlk_pmp_napot_config`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid ""
"Naturally Aligned Power Of Two. The region is `[address, address + "
"size)`. Base must be aligned to `size`; `size` must be a power of two, at"
" minimum 8 bytes."
msgstr ""
"自然对齐的 2 的幂。区域为 `[address, address + size)`。"
"基地址必须与 `size` 对齐；`size` 必须是 2 的幂，最小为 8 字节。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:31
msgid ""
"To use TOR with an explicit lower bound, call `tlk_pmp_entry_disable` on "
"`entry - 1` with the desired lower bound address. This writes the address"
" into `pmpaddr[entry-1]` without activating protection on that entry."
msgstr ""
"要使用带有显式下限的 TOR，请使用所需的下限地址在 `entry - 1` 上调用 "
"`tlk_pmp_entry_disable`。这会将地址写入 `pmpaddr[entry-1]`，"
"而不会在该条目上激活保护。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:36
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:38
msgid "Permissions are defined per entry via `struct tlk_pmp_config`:"
msgstr "每个条目的权限通过 `struct tlk_pmp_config` 定义："

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`r`"
msgstr "`r`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Allow read access."
msgstr "允许读取访问。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`w`"
msgstr "`w`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Allow write access."
msgstr "允许写入访问。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`x`"
msgstr "`x`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Allow instruction execution."
msgstr "允许指令执行。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`l`"
msgstr "`l`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Lock the entry. See [Lock](#lock) below."
msgstr "锁定条目。请参见下面的[锁定](#lock)。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:48
msgid "Lock"
msgstr "锁定"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:50
msgid "When `l = 1` is set on an entry:"
msgstr "当在条目上设置 `l = 1` 时："

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:52
msgid ""
"Writes to `PMPiCFG` and `PMPADDRi` are **ignored** by hardware until "
"system reset."
msgstr ""
"对 `PMPiCFG` 和 `PMPADDRi` 的写入在系统复位前将被硬件**忽略**。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:53
msgid "For TOR entries, `pmpaddr[entry-1]` is also frozen."
msgstr "对于 TOR 条目，`pmpaddr[entry-1]` 也会被冻结。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:54
msgid "Permissions apply to **all privilege modes**, including M-mode."
msgstr "权限适用于**所有特权模式**，包括 M 模式。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:56
msgid ""
"A locked entry can only be cleared by a system reset. Set `l = 1` only "
"when the protection must survive any software fault, including bugs in "
"M-mode code."
msgstr ""
"锁定的条目只能通过系统复位清除。仅在保护必须承受任何软件故障"
"（包括 M 模式代码中的错误）时设置 `l = 1`。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:67
msgid ""
"Configures `entry` in TOR mode. `address` is the exclusive upper bound of"
" the protected region."
msgstr ""
"在 TOR 模式下配置 `entry`。`address` 是保护区域的独占上限。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:74
msgid ""
"Configures `entry` in NAPOT mode. `address` must be aligned to `size`. "
"`size` must be a power of two and at least 8 bytes."
msgstr ""
"在 NAPOT 模式下配置 `entry`。`address` 必须与 `size` 对齐。"
"`size` 必须是 2 的幂且至少为 8 字节。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:81
msgid ""
"Sets the entry to OFF mode, removing any active protection. The value of "
"`address` is retained in `pmpaddr[entry]` and can serve as the lower "
"bound for a subsequent TOR entry. Pass `NULL` if the address is not "
"relevant. Has no effect if the entry is locked (`l = 1`)."
msgstr ""
"将条目设置为 OFF 模式，移除任何活动的保护。`address` 的值保留在 "
"`pmpaddr[entry]` 中，可作为后续 TOR 条目的下限。如果地址不相关，请传递 "
"`NULL`。如果条目已锁定（`l = 1`），则无效果。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:86
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md:88
msgid "All options are available under `PMP` in Kconfig."
msgstr "所有选项均在 Kconfig 的 `PMP` 下可用。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Symbol"
msgstr "符号"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`TLK_PMP_PM_DEVICE`"
msgstr "`TLK_PMP_PM_DEVICE`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid "`n`"
msgstr "`n`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/pmp.md
msgid ""
"Enable Power Management support. When enabled, all PMP entry registers "
"are saved before sleep and restored after wakeup."
msgstr ""
"启用电源管理支持。启用后，所有 PMP 条目寄存器在休眠前保存，在唤醒后恢复。"
